{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1101866-the-truman-show-in-the-world-of-darkness","id":1101866,"title":"The Truman Show in the World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-08T23:10:40-07:00","id":1101866,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> The Truman Show in the World of Darkness","content":"So I was making use of my time when not talking to my coworkers at work by thinking about stories I want to eventually run. So I was thinking it would be pretty interesting to have the Idea of the Truman Show, or whatever the individual is called, be a thing. So depending on the PCs you can have it at any phase of the program, either just starting, or Truman being older, or even a 2nd iteration. It can run in the background and be a point of conversation how the world has become so messed up that a Studio owns the rights to a child/man's life.<br /> <br /> The PCs could even be involved with shutting it down if so inclined. But the idea being if they leave it be it will eventually be the one thing that reveals the supernatural to the world. Basically depending on which supernatural group the PCs are its that one that gets revealed on the Show. So say they are Changelings, that could be the easiest situation, as the Mists help hide a lot, but this &quot;Truman&quot; will surely be done in by the Banality shortly after his Chrysalis unless freed. But even with the mists hundreds of millions of Viewers and constant recording would reveal too much to too many people if Truman goes Changeling. But this could swing open the Gates of Arcadia.<br /> <br /> If Truman is a Werewolf, good god that could be the worst situation, the Veil would be torn, and honestly if Werewolves become revealed, they are revealing Vampires and Fomori, and Spirits with them. If Vampire is the game, it could be interesting, A Methuselah wakes from torpor and entangles, and possibly embraces/ghouls Truman not knowing what the Hell Reality TV is possibly having been in Torpor before America or even the Camarilla became a Thing.<br /> <br /> Basically you would be able to have a full Chronicle doing whatever you want, and it would be a good method to play with the End of the World at your groups terms. Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T19:55:16-07:00","id":1102997,"title":"","content":"You could do this as a Mage adventure since it's about awakening. Truman being a Technocrat experiment with an enormously powerful avatar that they're watching in a artificial town/Horizon Realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T22:46:35-07:00","id":1103021,"title":"","content":"I've often toyed with the idea of doing something like The Truman Show meets Cabin In The Woods wherein a town is menaced by supernatural forces as part of a Technocratic experiment to observe the behavior of sleepers and reality deviants in a natural but controlled setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-27T04:44:14-07:00","id":1212223,"title":"","content":"So reading C20 and the Evanescence opened up Trods for the Thallain to swarm the world. So I'm thinking if Truman reveals magic, the nature of the revelation could be very important, because panic will lead to more Nightmares then Dreams swarming into the World.<br /> <br /> And if something like the Truman Shows has a Live Chrysalis and say calling the Wyrd and Unleashing would the Mists have a uniform effect, or would this being such a wide scale Mist Phenom would their be noticeable disparity in everyone's memory or even in rewatching the recording?<br /> <br /> And what if say Truman was a blank slate changeling, I've been tossing around the idea of Unnaming a Changeling and miracles naming its reincarnation and creating a one off kith. So what type of Kith would form from say Truman? The Everyman made Unknowing and Unwitting superstar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}